# =============================================================================
# Supabase configuration
# =============================================================================
#
# Only the `anon` (publishable, RLS-protected) key belongs in env files.
# NEVER put a `service_role` key in any .env file — it bypasses RLS.
#
# Quick start
# -----------
#   cp .env.example .env      # active env (gitignored)
#   npm start                 # reads .env → talks to Supabase
# =============================================================================

